those skills front end,

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:41.710
back end, services, web
applications, APIs, UI,

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:42.370
doesn't matter.

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:44.610
It works the whole
way across the stack.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:47.660
For me, I think that's the most
attractive quality of Node.

